<title>UK: IFC sets 1.0 billion Slovak crown one-year bond.</title>
<headline>IFC sets 1.0 billion Slovak crown one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTERNATIONAL FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN SKR   COUPON     13.625    MATURITY    07.MAY.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.85    PAY DATE    07.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 REOFFER    100.0     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 25-100-1M SALE LIMITS US/UK/SK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.85	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
